      "en": "Inside the workflow: sticky notes explaining the parts («why we retry here»), clear node names, a workflow description in settings, and tags (client, sensitivity, owner). And for each key workflow: a **loom** (a 3-minute video walking through it) — the fastest way to hand over knowledge."
