   "d": 5,
   "title": {
    "ar": "أرقام الوكالة",
    "en": "The agency’s numbers"
   },
   "goal": {
    "ar": "وكالة بتكسب فعلًا مش بس مشغولة.",
    "en": "An agency that actually profits, not just stays busy."
   },
   "learn": [
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "الهامش والاستغلال",
      "en": "Margin and utilisation"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "**gross margin** = (الإيراد − تكلفة التنفيذ) ÷ الإيراد — للخدمات هدف 50–70%. **utilization** = الساعات المدفوعة ÷ الساعات المتاحة (60–75% صحي؛ 100% = مفيش وقت للمبيعات والتطوير). مشروع «كبير» بهامش 15% أسوأ من صغير بـ 60%.",
      "en": "**gross margin** = (revenue − delivery cost) ÷ revenue — for services aim for 50–70%. **utilization** = billable hours ÷ available hours (60–75% is healthy; 100% = no time for sales and improvement). A «big» project at 15% margin is worse than a small one at 60%."
     },
     "ex": "September\nrevenue            92,000 EGP (projects 54,000 · care plans 38,000)\ndelivery cost      35,000 (team time 29,000 · tools/hosting 6,000)\ngross margin       62% ✓\nutilisation        Sara 71% · Omar 84% (overloaded) · junior 48% (needs projects)\nrecurring share    41% of revenue (target 50% — sell more care plans)"
    },
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "التدفق النقدي",
      "en": "Cash flow"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "**cash flow**: الوكالات بتقفل بسبب الفلوس اللي متأخرة مش بسبب الخسارة. مقدمات (40%)، دفعات على مراحل، فواتير الصيانة أول الشهر، متابعة الفواتير المتأخرة آليًا (n8n!)، واحتياطي 3 شهور مصاريف. والمشاريع بمدد دفع 60 يوم محتاجة سعر أعلى.",
      "en": "**cash flow**: agencies die from late money, not losses. Deposits (40%), milestone payments, care-plan invoices at the start of the month, automatic chasing of late invoices (n8n!), and a 3-month expense reserve. Projects with 60-day payment terms need a higher price."
     },
     "ex": "n8n \"accounts receivable\"\nevery morning → invoices due/overdue from the accounting app\n+3 days overdue → friendly reminder email · +10 → second reminder + WhatsApp to the contact\n+20 → pause non-critical work (per contract) + call · weekly: cash forecast for 90 days"
    },
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "الفريق والعقود",
      "en": "The team and contracts"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "لما تكبر: أدوار واضحة (مبيعات، تسليم، دعم)، توظيف juniors بتدريب (الرحلة دي نفسها!) ومراجعة شغلهم، وقوالب. وقانونيًا: **master services agreement** (MSA) واحد مع كل عميل وتحته SOWs، فيه **liability cap** (المسؤولية القصوى = مثلًا قيمة آخر 12 شهر)، الملكية الفكرية، السرية، والإنهاء — بمراجعة محامي.",
      "en": "As you grow: clear roles (sales, delivery, support), hiring juniors with training (this very journey!) and reviewing their work, and templates. Legally: one **master services agreement** (MSA) per client with SOWs under it, including a **liability cap** (maximum liability = e.g. the last 12 months’ fees), intellectual property, confidentiality and termination — reviewed by a lawyer."
     },
     "ex": "MSA (once per client, lawyer-reviewed)\n- services under SOWs · change control · acceptance\n- fees, invoicing, late payment, suspension rights\n- IP: client owns workflows built for them; agency keeps reusable templates/know-how\n- confidentiality + DPA annex (week 42)\n- liability cap: fees paid in the last 12 months; no indirect losses\n- term & termination: 30 days’ notice; handover assistance (paid)"
    }
   ],
